> Oh, one question on partial resistance. If you have 50% disintegration
> resistance, for example, does that give you a 50% chance of avoiding
> complete and total death or does it reduce the disintegration blast to
> damage? Likewise, does 5% fire resistance give you a 5% chance of
> avoidingall damage or does it reduce the damage by 5%?

Slightly different for these two, due to disintegration's instakill
effect.  For all resistances, in general, X% gives X% damage reduction
-- so if you have 50% fire resistance, you take half damage from fire.

If you have 50% or more disintegration resistance, however, you get an
additional benefit -- you also no longer can be completely
disintegrated, instead suffering HP/maxHP damage.  Less than 50% and
blasts can eradicate you completely once they get past your armor.

Glad you're enjoying it.  :)

